PART D CONCLUSION (referee): the recursion maps the family
  {P(s)+Q(s)*erfcx(s*sqrt(c/2))} to itself at EVERY order:
  (i)  d/ds keeps the family (erfcx' = c s erfcx - sqrt(2c/pi));
  (ii) poly-multiplication keeps it;
  (iii) the bounded solution of b' - c s b = A + B*erfcx stays in it
        (unique solvability shown constructively by family_solve_b).
  Hence EVERY a_k(s), b_k(s) is EXACT CLOSED FORM -- no quadrature
  layer is ever needed, contradicting ATTEMPT.md SS2.3/SS5(1).
